{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50367","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 二十、分流泉咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 二十、分流泉咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地涌澄泉美，环城本自奇。\n一源分异派，两道入汤池。\n波上青苹合，洲前翠柳垂。\n况逢佳景处，从此遂忘疲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}